     "_note": "NARPM's national events calendar (read through its iCal export). Often empty; new national events land here. Answers 404 to the scraper some weeks, so a 404 is logged as skipped, not broken.",
     "url": "https://www.narpm.org/events/",
     "unverified_urls": ["https://www.narpm.org/events/"]},

    {"id": "narpm-courses", "name": "NARPM", "group": "associations", "priority": 3, "parser": "date_heading",
